Package: ksrp-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: curl, wget, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0
Recommends: python3 | python3-minimal, nodejs
Installed-Size: 2048
Maintainer: KSRP Team <dev@ksrp.dev>
Description: KSPR Desktop - AI Code Analysis Assistant Installer
 KSPR Desktop is a graphical interface for the KSPR CLI,
 an AI-powered code analysis assistant.
 .
 This package installs the complete application including:
 - Qt6 native desktop application
 - React web interface
 - KSPR CLI backend
 - Auto-configuration on first run
 .
 Features include:
 - AI Chat with KSPR I assistant
 - File management and code ingestion
 - Real-time metrics dashboard
 - Glassmorphism UI design
 .
 After installation, run 'kspr-desktop' to start.
